              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlahhoó Naftali, múk Bet-shemeshi ngwaa guusi'iiká, tam kudá' baraá Bet-anati ngi hootá', ala nina hootiyé' baraá tla/ángw múk yaamaá Kana'anír wa ale, yaamuloouuse dinkwa nee múk Bet-shemeshi. Nee yaamuloouusér Bet-anati ngiri /uurutisiyé' baraá gadiyér tawa bihhií noongo'ootiiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.33",
